# The location pick list on a tree longer than its seek goes (#@ ROOMS):
# Move on Crate opens it where the seek for Crate's room gave up, and
# Enter there asks before choosing that row; N keeps the list and Esc
# then moves nothing.  Move again, Home and Enter choose the top level
# without a question.
#@ ROOMS
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END
S CRATE
K ALT-C
T M
S MISSPICK
K ENTER
S ASK
T N
S KEPT
K ESC
S UNMOVED
K ALT-C
T M
K HOME ENTER
S MOVED
K F3
T Y
